  "kind": "Personal agent",
  "tagline": "Nothing leaves your machine. Open weights end to end.",
  "description": "An example design for a fully local agent: open-weight models on your own GPU through Ollama, the small Pi harness with a permission-gate extension, Whisper and Kokoro for speech in and out, SQLite for memory and hybrid search, Docker for running code and Phoenix for tracing on the same machine. Slower and less capable than frontier APIs, but prompts and data stay on your hardware and there are no per-token fees.",
